{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:755f1d5ed21884dd603e672c079c3ab14300986229b0f7944f90d66bef52d484",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:737811db70a015a367074274ca52c88a644739f5f9a9c13c914c0fb7b820387b",
      "text": "汉子们的战斗理由",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395581e31a1e1220cddd110a1132a373119b4081aaee4364c073131ca2245d4c",
      "text": "因事故导致格斗家生涯断绝的道流，\n在从医院回家的路上，偶然走进一家拉面店，\n邂逅了命运的一碗。数年之后，\n拳击手武出于某种原因，\n敲响了偶像事务所的大门……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000012:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000012:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:737811db70a015a367074274ca52c88a644739f5f9a9c13c914c0fb7b820387b",
      "text": "汉子们的战斗理由",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da73a06e54f635d4dc4cc325c920046efe1c02d3aae7d5d6697960dfe4d59e85",
      "text": "欢迎光临！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8824f3dd5bf339d60c110bd66c3ab0d6e01fc04a01d17cfcb5b5256db21ff49c",
      "text": "来一碗拉面……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff24dc74a7d1117be99a53c4e09776e90f6ea329b27506b63cf29d84a0610115",
      "text": "（不知不觉被香味吸引，结果就进来了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1425b9cc27208a23f3e23888839ca021bd749e876fbc95e20a80a37c89e49e51",
      "text": "（就算在这种时候，肚子还是会饿啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7319a9905ff38adb377d0fbcb7e0c8700e5451556a5d304bbde4a2625fadeec7",
      "text": "那么，请多保重。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54d8d0e2410dc87322ecd04110ccec41fc40e0549f03c000f5dd60d8f942228a",
      "text": "好的，非常感谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca77d474c41174882058ce7b2cd88cbfe7fd539096e13b30702de84342a29426",
      "text": "（……已经不能再参加比赛了……吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b47628f7bc349e9dc6b5439c90c567db1cc362e19c6db86ebe94c669df9bf347",
      "text": "（真没想到，刚转入职业就遭遇了交通事故啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c87f48df4091ccf9a9f09b5989927a1ccdc8d7d533c9de2f7ae45caf22980db8",
      "text": "（幸好没有生命危险……\n但这伤势，作为格斗家而言却是致命伤）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:552106d931021efbc653a3a60af3128a673f0d75574ba99722e1e9798b4c29f4",
      "text": "（格斗比赛中，瞬息间的攻防就能分出胜负。\n要是无法像以前那样行动的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79b33d16b9b193ef9d04f41fef5bbe7d8e1004898e347cf5c797f87b495a5624",
      "text": "……我的梦想，也只能在这里放弃了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97bb7ea5ab98da666ba36eaf8c8731cd7600b23fc96536b35b62504edb431d49",
      "text": "咕噜～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cc031d69f4168d02b10d2729618872e05c63090591c9be44cdc6aeed43d9995",
      "text": "哈哈……去吃点东西吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fe792f1618675c8e2a4e624e72a2ee22b457de15628bad09dae9b05ee4e5477",
      "text": "（至今为止一直，全身心投入格斗技。\n然而，如今却化为乌有了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1d16b186069ed81f8f1053f9c6fe2b88f00fa11aba7ea408616f084d7f9aff2",
      "text": "（从今往后，我该怎么办才好……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bf3849c106847c107ebd8f0406d4a8439ac6f1f1acf5cffa8d27150fa0514bf",
      "text": "好咧，久等了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb56966c013513628bba4c765b1925f0268731ec69d2fc641a1b2fccb16ed0c",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n我开动了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f45ab9474322dd2a4bc5fd837f9f68614e21a063a1ce8d3db7cf1bed0d6d3685",
      "text": "嗯？怎么停筷子了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90bb3258d0560ff0c784509ae952908b834d14cf0ae8fc1c24db690ece90f8e7",
      "text": "……好吃。\n我从来没吃过这么好吃的拉面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf6e7c19ce6340fd0514f87b603e0600923381bb6890aa2c81d851cbcc1909e3",
      "text": "奇怪？因为太好吃了，不知怎么眼泪流下来了……\n嘿嘿，很奇怪对吧……可是，真的……太好吃了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f44b93f4ba79c82f2010f868a444fa6ef77254469a14c39052a8b8c4a213a44",
      "text": "……我们店里的拉面啊，\n越是拼命努力过的家伙，越是觉得好吃哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:005123b446780c231eb6057fb47e4912deea1b6136e6624cf7719945222d8fb7",
      "text": "（这个味道，是对至今为止的努力……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6d49ba5ed96ef31a9028eb5043768a5302dee03b82b0b0934fe6eecea858efa",
      "text": "（……啊啊，原来如此。我所做过的事情，\n绝不是毫无意义的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db19ab7207723dcff3cc765fd58d3b8b68ca2c91d592945ba043c4ae4ef5ba01",
      "text": "……嘿嘿，真是吃多少碗都还想吃的味道呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_b:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ee49d93d461401fa0deabe7434f4265352e370a6a2a2410f8fc078deada08f4",
      "text": "老板，再来一碗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_c:cmd-000013:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f41789a3f975725f965b9e44a78df3c090c2e74399319f3374cc0492972ca458",
      "text": "数年后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e2fba4c1dc652ff6bfeeabe71779d93353019a5c341c0641979c180215aee77",
      "text": "想详细了解偶像相关的说明吗……那么，\n连同试镜的内容，我来为您说明吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:344bda025dec918242fe434054c5ed05ec606d4645ebeb0ed8a84aa0e372b276",
      "text": "试镜？……总之，\n我想和了解详细情况的人谈谈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea39cb7b013f75f33f93c56f1229588789e9271ed405d4a641c370c9ca07020a",
      "text": "好的。我去叫负责人过来，请稍等片刻。\n在此之前，请先喝杯茶吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fa028b534c2b0fd206bab765bf02bcc187dba1a7b9a944ae3de3fc4c72f3f2a",
      "text": "（这里就是偶像事务所……\n本以为肯定会被赶出去的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2a0dc4b3222e167b601c89859049266cb4e8004fd4e288699871b564ad07f08",
      "text": "……真的可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aba676c59dd891a14fb9814b15c00f0b935f6a027cac296c8fd87f4df327e7eb",
      "text": "是的。粗茶一杯，请不用客气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b185421210a490b555cd056f74e2e98b29a7f7727e8fe57e32cc8fe99912c35f",
      "text": "我不是指这个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfbcb349cc82492be05db6e8cb47acbe07d93590d30d5dc64531c25770544e78",
      "text": "……不，谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbfb997ac8ab2eb294fe49000a916dd77a1409bbd71207995c25e0dbb8ee2a22",
      "text": "（虽然只是凭着一股冲劲，\n来到了拳馆里的杂志上刊登的地方……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14b2240bd28f800546818ac38724a2ba402e8727ae8fd8806508f2368d60194b",
      "text": "（这里真的会有妹妹的线索吗……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数天前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4189229a095ec39d148feff69c7c7a354a19978ccb717a229a5aa320b2d4c1f4",
      "text": "快看，街头的大屏幕！\n你推的那个人，不是上屏幕了吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2419e13c51fd90219246816061d397a6dbaae5d7959ff47016489976f6c0d0fe",
      "text": "真的耶！\n那场Live我也好想去啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:558c141a6da4e57ba703f0f875bc00bb011d5c530eab3e4756b22d6cf2db5687",
      "text": "（偶像是吗……似乎很受女生欢迎，\n妹妹现在也会喜欢上那种东西吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12ed7d91c59192b8c59a4b3a35590d01b17ec3ffbd07044388bfcbfe6bf8ac40",
      "text": "那家伙，现在在做些什么呢……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ee15c94f6d9098a83dae556a169cf077292d6546bac7142b89fba42ad73eb7d",
      "text": "不……可能吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b67fc6340bbfefd25ecf717c35695cebe6fe7e8189545a9c15d4e1f99a8e9dd",
      "text": "（刚才那是妹妹！为什么……\n为什么会在那里啊……！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8887a85ca67f0499e47eb5de462124c8ece99071fbda97e2728a6d12f8e01081",
      "text": "（虽然只是一瞬间，但我绝对不会认错）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:011de631b678d08fdcf7cf4753dbc873607d5463472a6ec6aea2baa39e59a4fe",
      "text": "（刚才映在观众席里的，\n毫无疑问是我小时候分开了的妹妹）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9de1ff9bdf362fdd0fecac28d889da72aef749b642cf5883e9c1293f1a2d35ce",
      "text": "（虽然为了找那个偶像打听情况，\n一路跑到了这种地方来……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66c31d35878725f52324b644522b75c496cccfa3715a6b6201dee723a7600c11",
      "text": "（冷静下来想想，这家事务所里\n也不一定有那个偶像啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87de0678f11c840bdd2e7453f5637449a75cef2a0f8bbafb01ec01af6a327d0b",
      "text": "（而且，连是偶像的粉丝还是相关人士都\n不知道的妹妹的情报，怎么可能拿得到……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd21271508c278655f6100439a039c3704e5e5e2cce389f881b9b345e802edd6",
      "text": "……算了，还是放弃吧。回去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_d:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3820a64efb44f87448fffd9ca9ec72e11f9a4a4a2aa9c1f47dd16d07b1aee0c5",
      "text": "抱歉让您久等了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_e:cmd-000010:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:801be6754edde91f050aa40c20a716c5a616f133259de440bbcc7a1c08b0261e",
      "text": "您就是来参加试镜的\n大河武先生吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8cf383dc5dd47c9ccb28e0cfb641d4abed800d4ee0b8bce242467e0c2583c05",
      "text": "啊、啊啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5576aad48cb8b16f15e1a395fd1f34b3a6b65028df34bcb65dfbb0e321b4f306",
      "text": "（说什么找妹妹，也太突兀了。\n反正就算说了也不会当回事吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63f391a7c3175c75b140f640647456449aba03b76fb8bffe40ccd36b33ca258d",
      "text": "……我要回去了。事情已经办完了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d6ca5ac9f4e34eed626f45c4d2437d984e8b3d45024f986e4fe2d5f236bbd84",
      "text": "哎？但是试镜的事情还没……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed30b407f3e06f04eecfc61db957e1bb96feffc771b029699bee92c1d8cb18db",
      "text": "抱歉。我并不是来参加试镜的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:986f692b7385892ad7149828103a28ca393581ae30e37139e44402829df9e04c",
      "text": "这样啊。\n……真是太遗憾了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6adab779a1df345bfb53ec566918f766df325ca6b5423de4a0314e7685fe0783",
      "text": "遗憾……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:294c925f95bcb0c3f94f76d49d5cd85193cfa5ac760858a6d15e6ac7046b7e91",
      "text": "是的。\n因为我从您身上，感受到了偶像所散发的光芒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aa62126f7e2bc43a09272f75ed9d32a3f700198c39738ef9497a5107bacfbfb",
      "text": "……哈啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_f:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bb0ea419780ae592c2dbe5d2ed6bd736bb005fb53198d38d17614f52317f4db",
      "text": "我……当偶像？\n你到底在说什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_f:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9f029e9a84bf62d7120cd9322b49773feb882baed2491f004800e5f41665a50",
      "text": "突然这么说想必让您很吃惊，\n但您身上确实具备作为偶像的资质。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_f:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c913b05d1c7fb3f2da9f34e24f78ea1db23cd07f8535dc3c9d4fb95d7ed1297c",
      "text": "能够紧紧抓住众人眼球的某种特质……\n那正是偶像的资质！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b55e567207832e0b8abcf58bacd6163bbd28b00bc1c7781b5172ddc234835568",
      "text": "……我当偶像什么的，简直莫名其妙。\n我本来就是个拳击手，根本不是干那个的料……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a101d1277d2a4f8c0efc6d833b8792a61ff115fb55f0ad229c2362f8a16dc604",
      "text": "（……不，等等）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d53af847d54f8a4921ece07bba7332d92dc1f3664a9fc7abd8a0f0140d0a5130",
      "text": "……要是当了偶像，\n也能登上Live舞台之类的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:966a8ab292bab2c99918b1f3e4081e286986b87aed51a06e6881d82f63d44c6f",
      "text": "当然可以！\n不过能否登上大舞台，就得看您的努力了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eff4f424ebd70486d6135fe7c1934f85c0c0a4b98c5973af12e745586fdde082",
      "text": "大舞台……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cef9c570c8bd827844db8fc2b091f249d504842bbbddd3b52bc609b76459f19e",
      "text": "（如果能变得和那个偶像一样出名，\n说不定就能进入妹妹的视野了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3f7413920d441e104f747611529b1fcf36efccbd70aebe212eb4f1dcf8cf95b",
      "text": "（不止是妹妹。连弟弟也是……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e59a8948aec05ebdcf4a4ff99cd950eeac37d03eebd473e01ea3d0fc5cb1e05",
      "text": "……收回前言。\n偶像试镜，我接受挑战！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_g:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80c2534ed55c6ef41e64319a444ef34b758f4eb955b54ac3b1203ae5a44ff7af",
      "text": "我想为您详细说明一下试镜的事宜，\n但由于武先生还是未成年人，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_g:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:715b30f1a0cc2ad0728997041bd29d3690017f2cd3ef2378479aa49f96a9607e",
      "text": "还请允许我向您的监护人也进行一番说明。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d943cd50c58d42d3970ff8102d83eaa7e754d1f8cd45292de00687245dc09b35",
      "text": "监护人……那个，\n能信任的熟人也行吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47dcd8c3a9243db04ab325926523f0773d428e57e81b1f72710b562eaabf15b0",
      "text": "可以的，只要是成年人就没问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23ddc16725118d4454a6b739df1ab45e491c0080c9e12c5e0840edb447213103",
      "text": "（……为了找弟弟才成为拳击手，\n却因为眼睛的问题，偏偏在暂时无法出赛的时候……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:465f5bde0a50c31d397c293f35722f0338bb4e55c33eac07dcfd02069bbfb774",
      "text": "（这次又为了妹妹，要以偶像为目标……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23732021829484ae3eaa8e1fd5a4ef0de5b6e56c140969b947625586be9c76bc",
      "text": "（……就算相隔两地，我的人生\n也依然和他们紧紧相连啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_g:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1389039080e15184d593335a1cf3b409219436c9e484bd4be1a95bc8f18dd2f3",
      "text": "那么，试镜的具体时间\n我们稍后会再行联络。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_g:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af463fb558bac366297813129e77307b3f3c4b1140fab00662d5c14d90892c95",
      "text": "我知道了。\n到时候，我会把监护人一起带过来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_g:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c9568393f0cab332318c11c01800fbf52e4ce632c477062d3ac330a13c1cf0f",
      "text": "（如果当拳击手不行的话，\n就作为偶像站上大舞台）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd09b3d21b377b544edcfe907b9bd8102dfc2ffeae131e6f8a6bc22f2f41e54e",
      "text": "（然后一定要……把他们找出来！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6a38ed1fe886c7e537f1e1227eaedf9c08b678361745ca13878ef2b36cd50e3",
      "text": "哈～啊……\n霸王也不在，今天好无聊啊……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3441c675e9a86f82c8876cac1a2e8bca45bc0dc0b5de614e369202aca0c5d985",
      "text": "那家伙……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db3b1fd622d4206c6fbc0c7ebfd4276e58fa1e55d73fd869281558ed45b85505",
      "text": "喂，小不点！站住！\n今天一定要跟你分出胜负！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d96d7499ddd9b2538136cab10c5f2384cdd289a429a6a1881dfad998a9dbb8e",
      "text": "又是你啊……\n抱歉，我没工夫陪你闹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03b4796a3a5a62139279963a11fa5eed77271071ff7b70f8e44ca67e5411fe5b",
      "text": "话说回来，你为什么总是\n找我茬啊？一天一天的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fb975374f652e04354893b7d922d125721caf25ae135e22a2caa461be6cf189",
      "text": "（这家伙……！本大爷第一次跟他交手的\n那天的事，他居然还没想起来！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c7552ab05af719932be07ccf3624c5af77bb85a17bc22438a586ec501128a1a",
      "text": "（气死人了！今天一定要打倒你，\n让你知道本大爷才是更强的那一个！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0be00c3ddda3d1b5a50b64ff40d1a435627aa3cb68ea4155bebf6c2a0782d339",
      "text": "废话少说，快点过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92741fead8013a35d20497921c2740c47d0ecbc325eaaa003b88064964dd8601",
      "text": "还是说，你是害怕输给本大爷\n所以吓破胆了啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b406624243f82824a3ee1c32e3b4a787f2e6652a408cef0ef75a4619a287e72",
      "text": "唉……随你的便吧。我走了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ca5d5dccafcbf6ffbb84eac40f8f47eb54968dc10177941bc692b3817b3ead1",
      "text": "哈啊！？你要逃跑吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd48c2258e55b61ecc99fe20e7e7ce99d0bb52b863cf94f9d6e6434de2f3ffb8",
      "text": "喂，别无视我啊，小不点！\n跟本大爷决胜负！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8ae8d13ff682764aff9e0acf57e743ad8f6b6f43bdf46197cebb572a8d12739",
      "text": "欢迎光临！\n哦，是武和涟啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a9b4209473fefb912a7601331baaed9d3fafddafebd968c62de3cef1e2829fe",
      "text": "今天你们两个，都有好好把门打开\n再走进来呢。真乖！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f66549388a068f77d73785aa38b6898a8436003f6b879f1f1d3726202856def5",
      "text": "求你别再提那件事了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5e962ca184642b090088b4a81f54f66fdb8d69c1045602bbcf26e0b65c12274",
      "text": "哼。那时候要不是拉面店的出来拦着，\n绝对是本大爷赢了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ef90613b9f4f3d962eeabd6beb7a2f99a6584754884afc1aa1f4a91314399b7",
      "text": "那都是很久以前的事了吧。话说你给人家\n添了那么多麻烦，居然还用这种口气……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bbd219f97574c285d310110fea8c8f21956f0a5fae49ee50de6cfacc9f8bf8d",
      "text": "好了好了。\n不说那个了，照旧就行吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:783bc5c6fdfd36e73e3001e194b9788588fa7e085b18e4b056e40cb9f29066a4",
      "text": "啧……要特大份的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c74c33aec5cb2eeaf8996e495423ab22d703f11624852531ffc2056cca6d3eea",
      "text": "（……那天找小不点打架，\n踢烂这家店的门之前的事我都记得）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec87d0e5f30b45b5e9291511a1f8536be977c489cd5851a1749f57ad97a346b4",
      "text": "（但之后的事就没记忆了。\n等回过神来，人已经在拉面店的家里了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17d0b59ffa763879eb1a854aec86babca55cd190627e3602e6e86a724e984a87",
      "text": "（没能分出胜负固然很火大，\n最糟糕的是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eee810edd31a355ee5b85234baa184638870785263d5ce80368a9de91cdd65c",
      "text": "好咧！特大份两碗，久等！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4f08fa14eaf7dc0b48fcf8b33a517bef4bea4734799daccc814f514cef88a53",
      "text": "（打从那天起，只要想跟小不点打架\n脑袋就会痛，根本顾不上动手！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_i:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2576e3f000d0753bfd4bd9964b67302f2416ae2c68630f526d55b4a6388df6b",
      "text": "（可恶……本大爷到底怎么了？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3d0983f67d2dd82b2b301e664a3f5ec1f4a091ea86491915750a017e380e39c",
      "text": "呼，吃得真饱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84d38ad659ad4f1794293c14b99e01d68ee60f953ea2a4a7c5deadf806cd21d2",
      "text": "今天可是本大爷比小不点\n吃得更快哦。心情爽快！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb8354bb19c7441c8a3793bfb243878034332025138049ded5072822c47bf292",
      "text": "……啊？拉面店的，这就关门了？\n偷懒啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2733ed879a14d7ba3da56247129c092097bc245edc7e408fcdda252d12cb530",
      "text": "没有，稍微陪武去办点事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b524761782b81addf67882aa2488baf61ce8585cb3883096ade0a9e5c43e4df",
      "text": "陪他？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bcf5f6a672f4c07b1d1fdaf74b637602c3dddecc825e047e70932d978451024",
      "text": "跟你没关系。\n别跟过来啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8018387567d3d5099a0c5d4ecb603562439bd5e54a04ac2111a6bc19e31efdfb",
      "text": "本大爷才对小不点的事没兴趣呢。\n谁要跟过去啊，大～笨蛋！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b92fad685ecba54ffb497592816175c08f5437ced0a7149a9e4c8b01e78d0df",
      "text": "那就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff81f4570801ba4a3214b2b6007b8ab4bc90ddfaa65049a0522da333f46ffdb6",
      "text": "那么，圆城寺先生……\n拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60253080c1e91766d2290f5d52ddc00b520fb7a08e52eba3b06e0d830a4d7d93",
      "text": "啊啊，走吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd96d2af34f354fa93c5830eb6467573fe891399b087c90d32a2d6873a5a5662",
      "text": "搞什么啊，那帮家伙……\n莫名其妙鬼鬼祟祟的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_01_1_1_013_01:1_1_013_01_j:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc25b154cbb5da15650926f153f4e418ce8f30ec912d3c8307c49480fa5b4241",
      "text": "那些家伙有什么事，本大爷才不感兴趣呢。\n只是今天碰巧想走“这边”而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
